OL,3,GNEWSA'Invincible' boy recovering after
OL,4,Abeing hit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was hit by a car and I survived and
OL,7,FI'm invincible... kind of," 11-year-old
OL,8,FCharlie said.
